==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{af|ru|так|же}}.

Cognates include {{cog|cs|takže}}, {{cog|csb|także}}, {{cog|pl|także}}, {{cog|szl|także}}, {{cog|sk|takže}} and  {{cog|sh|такође}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|та́кже|pos=adv}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-также.ogg}}

===Adverb===
{{ru-adv|та́кже}}

# [[also]], [[too]], [[as well]], [[likewise]]
#: {{ux|ru|[[он|Он]] '''та́кже''' [[приходить|прихо́дит]].|t=He is coming, '''too'''.}}
# {{qualifier|in negative constructions}} [[either]], [[neither]], [[nor]]

====Synonyms====
* {{l|ru|то́же}}
